            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi imfumu Usia ali ne fibashi ukushintafye no bushiku afwile. Aikele uwapatulwa ku ŋanda yakwe ico ali ne fibashi, kabili balimutalwishe na ku ŋanda yakwa Yawe. Ilyo acili mu bulwele umwana wakwe Yotamu ewalebomba imilimo ya pa bufumu no kutungulula abantu bonse aba mu calo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        }
